			"Message": "feat(Wind): Regenerate service interfaces and update documentation\n\nSynchronize the Wind service layer with upstream VS Code changes by regenerating all interface definitions in `Source/Effect/Generated` and updating the `CommandCatalog` and `ServiceCatalog`.\n\nKey modifications:\n- Added the new `IAgentHostDebugLogsExportService` interface for agent host log exports.\n- Updated `IChatOutputRendererService` to include `hasCodeBlockRenderer` and `renderCodeBlock` methods, reflecting upstream chat output changes.\n- Extended `IAgentHostTerminalManager` with `createAltBufferPromise` for terminal buffer handling.\n- Adjusted line numbers and member counts across `IConfigurationService`, `IExtHostLanguageModels`, and `ILanguageModelsService` to match upstream refactoring.\n- Updated `CommandCatalog` total to 547 commands and removed `_developer.getConfigurationInformation`.\n- Refreshed `README.md` to correct Tauri/Effect version badges, simplify architecture descriptions, and update the service directory tree and import tables.\n\nThese changes ensure the Wind UI service layer accurately mirrors the current upstream contribution registry and interface contracts.",
			"SHA": "66d5cafef0a012ed778a5c6843673094ce7d75b0"
		},
